  "content": "<!--$-->\n<!--/$-->\n<!--$-->\n<!--/$-->\n<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <a data-testid=\"geistcn/skip-nav-link\" class=\"fixed -m-px overflow-hidden whitespace-nowrap border-0 top-16 left-12 z-[1000] flex items-center outline-none text-[var(--geist-link-color)] px-1 py-0 bg-[var(--geist-background)] shadow-[0_0_0_2px_var(--geist-background),0_0_0_4px_var(--geist-link-color)] rounded-[var(--geist-radius)] opacity-0 pointer-events-none focus:opacity-100 focus:[pointer-events:_all]\" href=\"#geist-skip-nav\" tabindex=\"0\">Skip to content</a>\n  <div class=\"flex min-w-0\">\n   <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n    <div class=\"stack-module__BwJUkq__stack stack geist-soft-reset lg:first:pt-[calc(var(--banner-min-height))] stack-module__BwJUkq__padding\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--stack-flex:initial;--stack-direction:column;--stack-align:stretch;--stack-justify:flex-start;--sm-stack-padding:16px 0px;--md-stack-padding:32px 0px;--lg-stack-padding:90px 0px;--xl-stack-padding:90px 0px;--stack-gap:0px\">\n     <div class=\"max-w-(--ds-page-width-with-margin) px-(--geist-page-margin) mx-auto\">\n      <div class=\"gap-x-6 gap-y-6\">\n       <div class=\"[--article-full-width:calc(100%+2*var(--article-padding))] [--article-max-width:100%] [--article-padding:24px] [--grid-divider-gap:72px] [--guide-color:var(--ds-gray-200)]\">\n        <article>\n         <div class=\"flex flex-initial flex-col items-center justify-start gap-6 [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap\" data-customer-story=\"false\">\n          <div class=\"w-full max-w-(--article-max-width) contents [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;&gt;h2:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;h3:first-child]:!pt-0 [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:w-full [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:max-w-none [&amp;&gt;[data-geist-code-block]]:self-stretch\" data-blog-body=\"true\">\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Vercel CDN now supports Encrypted Client Hello (ECH) for domains managed by Vercel DNS. ECH encrypts the Server Name Indication (SNI) in the TLS handshake, the last part of an HTTPS connection that revealed which hostname a client was connecting to. With ECH, network observers see a connection to Vercel's shared ECH hostname, <code>vercel-ech.com</code>.</p>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">ECH is managed at the platform level and enables automatically where supported. Recent versions of Chrome, Edge, and Firefox <a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/understand-encrypted-client-hello\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/understand-encrypted-client-hello\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">support Encrypted Client Hello</a>.<!-- --></p>\n           <p class=\"text-copy-16 w-full [&amp;_b]:font-semibold [&amp;_u]:no-underline [&amp;_u]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:m-0 [&amp;_code]:rounded-md [&amp;_code]:bg-background-100 [&amp;_code]:bg-clip-padding [&amp;_code]:px-[5px] [&amp;_code]:py-1 [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-copy-14 [&amp;_code]:font-medium [&amp;_code]:break-normal [&amp;_code]:whitespace-nowrap [&amp;_code]:text-gray-1000 [&amp;_code]:shadow-[var(--ds-shadow-border-small)] @max-md:[&amp;_code]:break-words @max-md:[&amp;_code]:whitespace-pre-wrap\">Learn more about ECH and how Vercel CDN protects your application in the <a href=\"https://vercel.com/docs/cdn-security/encryption#encrypted-client-hello-ech\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_self\" data-track=\"true\" data-track-click-name=\"article_link\" data-track-click-value=\"https://vercel.com/docs/cdn-security/encryption#encrypted-client-hello-ech\" data-zone=\"null\" class=\"cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-2 outline-[var(--ds-focus-color)] outline-offset-4 text-gray-1000 decoration-1 underline-offset-4 underline decoration-gray-700 [:not([aria-disabled])]:hover:decoration-inherit [&amp;_u]:no-underline\">CDN encryption</a> documentation.</p>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </article>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n      <section class=\"items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-8 pt-8\" data-cdp-scope=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;pre_footer&quot;}\">\n       <h2 class=\"text-balance text-gray-1000 [--font-weight-semibold:450] text-heading-64 tracking-tighter col-span-full\">Ready to deploy?</h2>\n       <div class=\"col-span-full flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n        <a role=\"link\" href=\"https://vercel.com/new\" type=\"submit\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" data-cdp-track=\"{&quot;event&quot;:&quot;pre_footer_cta_clicked&quot;}\" data-zone=\"2d9dc9\" class=\"outline-none m-0 p-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium !px-(--geist-gap-half) max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:transition-none data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] aria-disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] disabled:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] [--x-padding:10px] [--height:var(--ds-size-medium)] text-[14px] !rounded-full h-[var(--height)] data-hover:bg-[var(--themed-hover-bg,_hsl(0,_0%,_22%))] dark-theme:data-hover:bg-[var(--themed-hover-bg,_hsl(0,_0%,_80%))] data-hover:[--themed-border:var(--themed-hover-bg,_var(--ds-gray-200))] data-hover:disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)]\" data-geist-button=\"\" data-prefix=\"false\" data-suffix=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--geist-icon-size:16px\"><span class=\"truncate inline-block px-1.5\">Start deploying</span></a><a role=\"link\" type=\"submit\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" data-cdp-track=\"{&quot;event&quot;:&quot;pre_footer_cta_clicked&quot;}\" data-zone=\"same\" class=\"outline-none m-0 p-0 border-0 align-baseline no-underline group/trigger relative cursor-pointer select-none transform translate-z-0 flex text-[var(--themed-fg,_var(--ds-background-100))] bg-[var(--themed-bg,_var(--ds-gray-1000))] font-medium !px-(--geist-gap-half) max-w-full items-center justify-center transition-[border-color, background,color,transform,box-shadow] duration-[time:150ms] ease-in-out data-[focus]:shadow-[var(--ds-focus-ring)] [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] aria-disabled:text-[var(--ds-gray-700)] aria-disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] disabled:![--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] [--x-padding:10px] [--height:var(--ds-size-medium)] text-[14px] !rounded-full [--themed-bg:_var(--ds-background-100)] shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--themed-border,_transparent)] [--themed-hover-bg:_var(--ds-gray-alpha-200)] [--themed-fg:_var(--ds-gray-1000)] [--themed-border:_var(--ds-gray-400)] data-[focus]:shadow-[0_0_0_1px_var(--themed-border,_transparent),0_0_0_2px_var(--ds-background-100),0_0_0_4px_var(--ds-focus-color)] data-[focus]:transition-none h-[var(--height)] data-hover:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)] dark-theme:data-hover:bg-[var(--ds-gray-200)] data-hover:text-[var(--themed-fg)] data-hover:disabled:bg-[var(--ds-gray-100)]\" data-geist-button=\"\" data-prefix=\"false\" data-suffix=\"false\" data-version=\"v1\" style=\"--geist-icon-size:16px\" href=\"https://vercel.com/contact/sales\"><span class=\"truncate inline-block px-1.5\">Talk to an expert</span></a>\n       </div>\n      </section>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <!--$-->\n    <!--/$-->\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n  <!--$-->\n  <!--/$-->\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "Vercel CDN 现已为 Vercel DNS 管理的域名支持加密客户端问候 (ECH)，通过在 TLS 握手期间加密服务器名称指示 (SNI) 来增强隐私。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "Vercel CDN 现已为 Vercel DNS 管理的域名支持加密客户端问候 (ECH)，通过在 TLS 握手期间加密服务器名称指示 (SNI) 来增强隐私。",
  "summary": "Vercel 宣布在其 CDN 平台上为使用 Vercel DNS 的域名提供加密客户端问候 (ECH) 的平台级支持。ECH 通过加密服务器名称指示 (SNI) 解决了 HTTPS 中长期存在的隐私漏洞，此前 SNI 会向网络观察者泄露目标主机名。当 ECH 启用时，观察者只能看到与 Vercel 共享主机名 vercel-ech.com 的通用连接。该功能已针对 Chrome、Edge 和 Firefox 等支持的现代浏览器自动启用，开发者无需进行额外配置。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
      "point": "Vercel DNS 支持 ECH",
      "explanation": "Vercel CDN 现已为所有通过 Vercel DNS 管理的域名支持加密客户端问候，提供更安全的连接层。"
    },
    {
      "point": "通过 SNI 加密增强隐私",
      "explanation": "ECH 加密了服务器名称指示 (SNI)，防止网络观察者识别客户端正在连接的具体网站。"
    },
    {
      "point": "自动平台级管理",
      "explanation": "该功能在平台层面进行管理，并为 Chrome、Edge 和 Firefox 等支持的浏览器自动启用。"
    }
  ],
  "keyQuotes": [
    "ECH 加密了 TLS 握手中的服务器名称指示 (SNI)，这是 HTTPS 连接中最后一个会泄露客户端所连接主机名的部分。",
    "通过 ECH，网络观察者只能看到与 Vercel 共享的 ECH 主机名 vercel-ech.com 的连接。"
  ],
